pkmn:terastallization a pkmn:GenerationMechanic ; rdfs:label "Terastallization"@en ; pkmn:introducedIn pkmn:gen9 .

## Version groups ##
# A set of games that share one data set. Downloadable content belongs to its base game.
pkmn:versionGroupRedBlue a pkmn:VersionGroup ; rdfs:label "Red-Blue"@en ; mo:partOf pkmn:gen1 .
pkmn:versionGroupYellow a pkmn:VersionGroup ; rdfs:label "Yellow"@en ; mo:partOf pkmn:gen1 .
