## Type condition immunities ##
# A type that cannot gain a status condition, or that a move flag does not affect.
pkmn:Fire     pkmn:immuneTo pkmn:statusBurn .
pkmn:Ice      pkmn:immuneTo pkmn:statusFreeze, pkmn:statusFrostbite .
pkmn:Electric pkmn:immuneTo pkmn:statusParalysis .
pkmn:Poison   pkmn:immuneTo pkmn:statusPoison, pkmn:statusBadlyPoisoned .
pkmn:Steel    pkmn:immuneTo pkmn:statusPoison, pkmn:statusBadlyPoisoned .
pkmn:Grass    pkmn:immuneTo pkmn:powder .

## Condition blocks ##
# A terrain or a side effect that stops conditions from applying.
pkmn:electricTerrain pkmn:blocksCondition pkmn:statusSleep, pkmn:volatileDrowsy .
pkmn:mistyTerrain    pkmn:blocksCondition pkmn:statusBurn, pkmn:statusFreeze, pkmn:statusParalysis, pkmn:statusPoison, pkmn:statusBadlyPoisoned, pkmn:statusSleep, pkmn:confused .
pkmn:safeguard       pkmn:blocksCondition pkmn:statusBurn, pkmn:statusFreeze, pkmn:statusParalysis, pkmn:statusPoison, pkmn:statusBadlyPoisoned, pkmn:statusSleep, pkmn:confused .

## Condition inflictions ##
# An entry hazard that applies a status condition to a Pokemon that switches in.
pkmn:toxicSpikes pkmn:inflictsCondition pkmn:statusPoison, pkmn:statusBadlyPoisoned .

## Legends-only conditions ##
# Conditions that exist only in the games named here. A snapshot query that leaves these games out reads these edges.
pkmn:statusFrostbite mo:appearsIn pkmn:versionGroupLegendsArceus .
pkmn:statusDrowsy    mo:appearsIn pkmn:versionGroupLegendsArceus, pkmn:versionGroupLegendsZA .
